### Usar con la extensión REST Client. Ejecutar login y pegar token.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN
@idTarea = 1

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"Contraseña1"}

### Identidad
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listado global
GET {{baseUrl}}/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle
GET {{baseUrl}}/tareas/{{idTarea}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear (admin o superadmin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"grupo":"user","titulo":"Preparar frontend Angular","descripcion":null,"prioridad":"2:alta"}

### Editar (creador o superadmin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tareas/{{idTarea}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"titulo":"Título actualizado","descripcion":"Detalle actualizado"}

### Finalizar (grupo destinatario exacto)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tareas/{{idTarea}}/finalizacion
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Borrar (solo creador)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tareas/{{idTarea}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Perfil propio
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
